('ovation-medical', 'shoulder-immobilizer', 'Shoulder Abduction Sling', null, null, '["Provides shoulder abduction, promoting effective healing and recovery.", "The pillow portion rests comfortably on the waist to support the arm, alleviating strain.", "Easy to adjust with hook and loop straps.", "Made from breathable cotton for enhanced comfort and wearability.", "Durable cotton sling ensures long-lasting use and optimal support.", "Hook and loop closure adjustments on all straps allow for a personalized fit.", "Fits both the right and left arm, adding to its versatility.", "The waist strap helps prevent shoulder rotation, promoting effective healing.", "Included shoulder pad offers additional comfort.", "Figure-8 shoulder orthosis effectively supports the clavicle, facilitating recovery.", "Easily adjustable hook and loop closures allow for a personalized, secure fit.", "Padded straps enhance comfort, promoting increased patient compliance."]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '{"Size": ["Small", "Medium", "Large", "X-Small", "X-Large"]}'::jsonb, '["L3670", "L3650"]'::jsonb, '/assets/products/ovation-medical/shoulder-immobilizer.png', 'Upper Extremity', 9, '["57013", "57015", "57017", "57018", "59022", "59023", "59025", "59027", "59028"]'::jsonb, '30, 31', '["Ovation_Medical_Coded_Product_Catalog_2026.pdf", "Ovation_Medical_Retail_Catalog_2026.pdf"]'::jsonb, 0.93, 'single_unit_x2', 'pending_review'),
