('ovation-medical', 'gauze', 'Gauze Sponges', null, null, '["Ideal for dressing, cleaning, prepping, or packing wounds.", "Stringent manufacturing controls guarantee clean, debris-free packaging.", "Folded edges prevent lint and unraveling.", "Individually packaged to prevent intrusion of dust and contaminants.", "Sterile peel pouches facilitate easy opening.", "Absorbent, breathable, low-lint fabric helps stop bleeding and accelerates the healing process.", "Latex-free gauze provides ample stretch, easily conforming to various body parts.", "Sticks to itself, reducing need for excess tape.", "Allows for some controlled movement and soft-tissue swelling."]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '{"Size": ["Sterile 2x2 12ply", "Sterile 3x3 12ply", "Sterile 4x4 12ply", "Non-Sterile 2x2 12ply", "Non-Sterile 3x3 12ply", "Non-Sterile 4x4 12ply", "Non-Sterile 2x2 8ply", "Non-Sterile 3x3 8ply", "Non-Sterile 4x4 8ply", "2\" x 4.1 yd", "3\" x 4.1 yd", "4\" x 4.1 yd"]}'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '/assets/products/ovation-medical/gauze.png', 'Gauze Sponges', 16, '["GS222SN", "GS233SN", "GS244SN", "GS822SN", "GS833SN", "GS844SN", "GS222SS", "GS233SS", "GS244SS", "BH002SN", "BH003SN", "BH004SN", "GN108BL", "GN107BL", "GN103BL", "GN105BL"]'::jsonb, '33, 34', '["Ovation_Medical_Coded_Product_Catalog_2026.pdf", "Ovation_Medical_Retail_Catalog_2026.pdf"]'::jsonb, 0.93, 'single_unit_x2', 'pending_review'),
